# `CompactQuantumMetrics` — Root Module

Standalone Lean Reservoir library: finite-dimensional Rieffel-Connes compact quantum metric spaces, Lip-seminorms, Woronowicz O_q(SU(2)), and universal differentials.

Individual modules are built via `globs = ["CompactQuantumMetrics", "CompactQuantumMetrics.+"]` in `lakefile.toml`; import targeted `CompactQuantumMetrics.<Module>` submodules directly rather than this root.
